# Stage B outputs (D37/Y7): raw trajectories and data stay out of git (D37;
# also the 只算不存 policy: the cluster holds the compute, the repo holds the
# evidence summaries). cluster_results/ keeps per-job final.data + equil.dump
# + log.lammps (small) -- the thinned prod series stay local-only, listed by
# the sha256 manifest, retrievable from the analysis archive on demand.
*
!cluster_results/
!cluster_results/**
!cluster_results/**/final.data
!cluster_results/**/equil.dump
!cluster_results/**/log.lammps
!cluster_results/**/manifest.json
!stageB_inputs.py
!stageB_queue.py
!jobs_index.json
!README*.md
